## 🎯 Overview

**DataMind** is an intelligent business analytics tool that bridges the gap between complex databases and non-technical users. Instead of writing SQL queries, simply ask questions in plain English:

> ❓ *"What were our top-selling products last month?"*  
> ✅ *"The top-selling product last month was MacBook Pro with 45 units sold, generating $89,999.55 in revenue."*

