## ✨ Features

- 🗣️ **Natural Language Queries**: Ask questions in plain English
- 🤖 **AI-Powered**: Uses GPT-4o-mini for intelligent SQL generation
- 🔒 **Secure**: Read-only queries with SQL injection prevention
- 📊 **Real-time Analytics**: Instant answers from your database
- 🎨 **Modern UI**: Clean, responsive Streamlit interface
- 🛡️ **Error Handling**: Graceful degradation for API failures
- 📈 **Scalable**: Tested with 1000+ records

